WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Safex

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.306
In order to meet Terrius,

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:15.446
Candy jumped into a carriage
and headed towards Elmore Theatre.

00:00:15.716 --> 00:00:18.850
The show is minutes away.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:24.148
Terrius will be leaving
Chicago tomorrow.

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:38.129
The shadow under the spotlight

00:00:50.885 --> 00:00:52.610
What happened to Candy?

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.647
Annie, is she here yet?

00:00:55.823 --> 00:00:57.613
Did she have an accident?

00:00:57.863 --> 00:01:00.552
Archie, mind your words!

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.591
Candy won't be coming.

00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:05.664
Eliza, did you again...

00:01:05.874 --> 00:01:08.190
If Candy is smart,

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:09.894
she won't be coming.

00:01:10.044 --> 00:01:11.362
What do you mean?

00:01:11.512 --> 00:01:15.230
Practice nurses are not supposed
to be here tonight.

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:18.870
Candy is still a member
of the Adley family.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.708
Please take your seat.

00:01:20.915 --> 00:01:22.342
We are waiting for a friend.

00:01:22.592 --> 00:01:26.344
Entrance is not allowed
after the show started.

00:01:26.594 --> 00:01:30.747
We should go in
five minutes prior to the show.

00:01:32.126 --> 00:01:33.650
Please take your seat.

00:01:36.997 --> 00:01:39.189
Mr. Robert, I can't find Terrius.

00:01:39.339 --> 00:01:41.661
Susanna, I thought you were together?

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:44.024
We were, a minute ago, backstage.

00:01:44.174 --> 00:01:46.230
How irresponsible!

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.604
I guess we need to delay the show.

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:51.001
I'll go look for him.

00:01:51.251 --> 00:01:52.669
Do you know where he is?

00:01:53.009 --> 00:01:54.738
No.

00:01:54.888 --> 00:01:57.248
I searched all over,
except the audience stands.

00:01:57.651 --> 00:01:59.077
- I found him!
- Where?

00:01:59.227 --> 00:02:01.036
- In the audience stands.
- Whereabouts?

00:02:01.188 --> 00:02:03.015
The third floor, right in the middle.

00:02:09.163 --> 00:02:10.892
What does he thinks he is doing?

00:02:11.565 --> 00:02:13.396
No. I'm going.

00:02:13.701 --> 00:02:16.359
Please reprimand him.

00:02:16.509 --> 00:02:18.968
The show will never start like this!

00:02:23.444 --> 00:02:26.743
Terrius, since when you became
a member of the audience?

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.206
I will show up when I am supposed to.

00:02:29.383 --> 00:02:31.647
The director is angry.

00:02:32.119 --> 00:02:35.617
Mr. Robert, why are there
no audience on the third floor?

00:02:36.824 --> 00:02:41.153
Tonight's show is for charity,
only people with high status will attend.

00:02:41.303 --> 00:02:45.358
Can't they come to the third floor?

00:02:54.141 --> 00:02:55.465
Look.

00:02:56.277 --> 00:02:59.805
What do you think those people would say if
they knew there are seats on the third floor?

00:02:59.997 --> 00:03:05.541
Terrius, just focus on your job as a performer.

00:03:10.257 --> 00:03:12.487
Another celebrity who is late.

00:03:17.798 --> 00:03:18.853
Candy!

00:03:18.993 --> 00:03:20.231
You made it!

00:03:20.551 --> 00:03:22.308
Sorry I am late!

00:03:22.458 --> 00:03:25.254
It is ok, the show is delayed.

00:03:25.856 --> 00:03:28.791
You wouldn't be able to come in
if it wasn't for the delay.

00:03:29.593 --> 00:03:32.153
I was so worried back in the carriage!

00:03:32.703 --> 00:03:34.462
Candy, hurry! It's going to start!

00:03:44.775 --> 00:03:46.208
Hurry! It's going to start!

00:03:47.311 --> 00:03:48.264
Candy!

00:03:48.414 --> 00:03:49.970
How come you are here?

00:03:52.783 --> 00:03:54.444
Alistear, Archibald...

00:03:56.486 --> 00:03:59.013
Who let her in?

00:03:59.163 --> 00:04:01.645
Candy is adopted by the Adleys.

00:04:01.795 --> 00:04:04.158
- Why can't she come?
- Shut up!

00:04:04.628 --> 00:04:06.493
There is no seat for Candy here.

00:04:08.598 --> 00:04:11.990
Grand Aunt, Candy is Grandfather William's...

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.091
Candy, let’s make this clear.

00:04:14.241 --> 00:04:19.067
Have you separated from the Adleys
by your own will?

00:04:19.217 --> 00:04:20.609
Grand Aunt...

00:04:20.977 --> 00:04:23.302
These seats are for the Adleys only.

00:04:23.452 --> 00:04:26.474
Grand Aunt, you must let me
attend the show tonight!

00:04:26.624 --> 00:04:28.813
My friend is performing!

00:04:31.021 --> 00:04:34.923
Friend? Come on!

00:04:36.393 --> 00:04:40.550
Terry forgot about you.

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.623
Stop lying to yourself.

00:04:42.799 --> 00:04:45.760
There is something between Terry
and the leading actress.

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:47.259
The leading actress?

00:04:47.609 --> 00:04:50.601
Susanna Marlowe. She is very beautiful!

00:04:50.881 --> 00:04:51.994
Shut up, Eliza!

00:04:52.144 --> 00:04:54.367
Grand Aunt, please give Candy a seat.

00:04:54.517 --> 00:04:57.237
There are plenty of empty seats!

00:04:57.487 --> 00:05:01.407
No. And I will send you too out
if you don't stop talking.

00:05:01.657 --> 00:05:02.944
Right. Let's go.

00:05:03.194 --> 00:05:04.511
OK, brother.

00:05:04.761 --> 00:05:06.451
Forget it, I'm out of here!

00:05:07.156 --> 00:05:08.450
Candy!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.318
Candy!

00:05:13.296 --> 00:05:15.992
The show has begun, please take your seats.

00:05:24.907 --> 00:05:27.002
The show has started, I need to hurry.

00:05:32.548 --> 00:05:34.571
I can't afford to regret it.

00:05:34.721 --> 00:05:37.551
It was not easy
to swap shifts with Natalie.

00:05:40.189 --> 00:05:45.918
I thought the King liked more
the Duke of Albany than Cornwall.

00:05:46.068 --> 00:05:48.017
It did always seem so to us.

00:05:48.167 --> 00:05:51.156
But now, in the division of the kingdom...

00:05:56.739 --> 00:06:00.038
I need to find a seat as soon as possible.

00:06:08.751 --> 00:06:12.744
Meantime we shall express
our darker purpose.

00:06:13.489 --> 00:06:15.114
Give me the map there.

00:06:15.264 --> 00:06:18.752
Know we have divided in three
our kingdom;

00:06:18.902 --> 00:06:21.990
and 'tis our fast intent to shake
all cares and business from our age...

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:23.919
No I can't see anything from here.

00:06:24.069 --> 00:06:26.556
Someone will find me sooner or later,
I need to go somewhere else.

00:06:26.706 --> 00:06:28.159
I must find another place.

00:06:33.542 --> 00:06:36.734
The show will not be interrupted.
I really need to find a seat soon.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:41.374
This area is for authorised personnel only!

00:06:41.524 --> 00:06:42.505
Get out!

00:06:42.655 --> 00:06:43.812
- But...
- Quick!

00:06:49.424 --> 00:06:52.487
I am so close and not a glance of him!

00:06:54.897 --> 00:06:57.388
I could go upstairs!

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:06.464
Now, our joy,

00:07:06.614 --> 00:07:09.700
Although the last, not least;

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:12.076
to whose young love.

00:07:12.414 --> 00:07:15.871
The vines of France

00:07:16.021 --> 00:07:19.477
and milk of Burgundy

00:07:19.655 --> 00:07:23.213
Strive to be interest;
what can you say to draw

00:07:23.363 --> 00:07:27.149
A third more opulent than your sisters?
Speak.

00:07:27.299 --> 00:07:29.285
Nothing, my lord.

00:07:29.535 --> 00:07:31.328
Nothing?

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.125
Nothing.

00:07:33.475 --> 00:07:35.559
Nothing can come of nothing.

00:07:35.709 --> 00:07:37.359
Speak again.

00:07:37.509 --> 00:07:43.303
Unhappy that I am, I cannot heave...

00:07:47.416 --> 00:07:48.747
This place...

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.911
I can see from here!

00:08:02.998 --> 00:08:04.295
Terry...

00:08:06.902 --> 00:08:12.806
I would not from your love make such a stray
To match you where I hate;

00:08:13.008 --> 00:08:19.140
therefore beseech you
T'avert your liking a more worthier way

00:08:19.348 --> 00:08:22.408
Than on a wretch whom nature is asham'd
Almost t' acknowledge hers.

00:08:23.485 --> 00:08:24.977
This is most strange,

00:08:25.127 --> 00:08:27.880
That she that even but now
was your best object,

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:30.349
The argument of your praise,
balm of your age,

00:08:30.499 --> 00:08:32.859
Most best, most dearest,

00:08:33.261 --> 00:08:36.920
should in this trice of time

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.454
Commit a thing so monstrous to dismantle
So many folds of favour

00:08:39.604 --> 00:08:41.156
Sure her offence

00:08:41.306 --> 00:08:45.263
Must be of such unnatural degree

00:08:45.613 --> 00:08:50.843
That monsters it,
or your fore-vouch'd affection

00:08:51.546 --> 00:08:54.103
Terry, you did it!

00:08:54.253 --> 00:08:56.776
You are great!

00:08:57.018 --> 00:08:58.810
Fall'n into taint;
which to believe of her

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:03.619
Must be a faith that reason without miracle
Should never plant in me.

00:09:04.359 --> 00:09:05.587
Terry...

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:10.223
Are you dreaming, Miss Freckles ?

00:09:13.335 --> 00:09:14.898
Miss Freckles ?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:19.101
You must have a pretty face
buried underneath those freckles !

00:09:22.144 --> 00:09:24.942
You must like your flat nose too ?

00:09:27.756 --> 00:09:29.478
Terry...

00:09:29.551 --> 00:09:33.082
I understand.
Just yell Anthony's name!

00:09:33.321 --> 00:09:35.016
Please, don't die!

00:09:35.991 --> 00:09:38.384
Why did you stop yelling?

00:09:38.534 --> 00:09:40.552
Yell!

00:09:51.673 --> 00:09:54.203
Why did you stop?

00:10:13.661 --> 00:10:15.720
Terry, we meet at last!

00:10:15.897 --> 00:10:17.757
I am here!

00:10:17.907 --> 00:10:19.922
Look here, Terry!

00:10:20.072 --> 00:10:22.127
Come, my fair Cordelia.

00:11:29.504 --> 00:11:30.971
Terry...

00:11:37.478 --> 00:11:40.271
They were great!
Especially the king of France!

00:11:40.421 --> 00:11:42.174
It was excellent.

00:11:42.883 --> 00:11:45.777
You were great, Terry !
You were the best.

00:11:45.927 --> 00:11:48.712
I will go to cabins.
I will meet Terry for sure!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:04.871
Where is Terrius cabin?

00:12:06.941 --> 00:12:09.664
Why are you still here?

00:12:09.814 --> 00:12:13.035
I am  Terry's...
I mean Mr. Terrius'...

00:12:13.914 --> 00:12:16.212
Go away, you can't come in here!

00:12:17.118 --> 00:12:18.510
It won't take a minute!

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.108
You can wait him at the exit.

00:12:21.258 --> 00:12:23.711
He will attend the banquet later.

00:12:23.861 --> 00:12:25.121
Thank you.

00:12:29.797 --> 00:12:32.056
He will come out in a second!

00:12:32.206 --> 00:12:34.464
I want to get his autograph.

00:12:38.939 --> 00:12:40.566
So many fans!

00:12:51.618 --> 00:12:53.011
I will see Terry at last!

00:12:53.261 --> 00:12:55.047
I want to go talk to him.

00:12:55.597 --> 00:12:57.324
Hey! Don't jump in!

00:12:57.691 --> 00:12:59.955
Excuse me, sorry.

00:13:05.666 --> 00:13:08.223
Terry is coming out!

00:13:08.373 --> 00:13:10.803
Terrius!

00:13:25.553 --> 00:13:28.613
Terry, here!

00:13:31.425 --> 00:13:32.949
Terry!

00:13:38.198 --> 00:13:40.259
Terry wait!

00:13:45.539 --> 00:13:47.230
If he gets in the carriage...

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.166
Terry, here!

00:13:49.316 --> 00:13:51.972
Terry!

00:14:03.457 --> 00:14:04.856
Susanna, get in!

00:14:06.193 --> 00:14:07.490
Terry!

00:14:12.332 --> 00:14:14.664
Terry, wait!

00:14:28.548 --> 00:14:31.139
Terry, you were heading towards me...

00:14:31.289 --> 00:14:34.186
Didn't you see me? Or...

00:14:35.021 --> 00:14:37.717
Terry and Susanna...
Didn't you know?

00:14:39.326 --> 00:14:42.659
Was Susanna the pretty lady from just now?

00:14:45.599 --> 00:14:47.992
No! I don't believe it!

00:14:48.142 --> 00:14:51.366
Terry,
you didn't pretend not to see me did you ?

00:14:54.274 --> 00:14:55.707
Terry!

00:15:15.782 --> 00:15:17.538
Is anything wrong, Terry?

00:15:17.768 --> 00:15:19.458
Nothing!

00:15:19.666 --> 00:15:22.622
It was a great show tonight,
you did so well!

00:15:22.772 --> 00:15:26.496
I clearly heard Candy
calling out from the crowd.

00:15:26.646 --> 00:15:29.473
I hope to see you again, Candy.

00:16:06.913 --> 00:16:08.969
At the academy in London...

00:16:09.119 --> 00:16:11.155
Summer school in Scotland...

00:16:11.305 --> 00:16:13.775
You, smiling at me...

00:16:14.187 --> 00:16:18.214
Where did that smile go?

00:16:18.458 --> 00:16:19.857
Terry...

00:16:49.856 --> 00:16:52.188
At last, I thought I could see you...

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:10.167
What a grand banquet!

00:17:10.317 --> 00:17:14.007
Mr. Mayor, it's an honour to be here.

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.238
Mr. Robert.

00:17:16.388 --> 00:17:20.682
This banquet is to thank you and your crew.

00:17:20.853 --> 00:17:25.449
No, we should toast to King Lear
and Shakespeare.

00:17:25.925 --> 00:17:30.450
You were so outstanding
and so was the King of France...

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:34.008
Terrius?
He has a lot of potential.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.696
He is surrounded by the girls.
He can't even walk.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.028
He still has a lot to learn.

00:17:41.178 --> 00:17:42.932
What a bright future!

00:17:43.082 --> 00:17:45.469
I guess he might be
a second Robert Hathaway?

00:17:45.619 --> 00:17:46.704
I hope so.

00:17:47.254 --> 00:17:50.204
Mr. Terrius, you are so handsome!
Please sign an autograph for me!

00:17:50.354 --> 00:17:51.908
Me too.

00:17:53.452 --> 00:17:55.818
Why do I feel so uneasy?

00:17:57.289 --> 00:17:58.980
Terry!

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:01.139
I can't forget her voice.

00:18:02.995 --> 00:18:05.486
Come on, it can't be Candy!

00:18:05.898 --> 00:18:06.787
Mr. Terrius.

00:18:06.937 --> 00:18:09.922
Please stop by our place
during your stay in Chicago.

00:18:10.072 --> 00:18:12.162
I have a huge garden.

00:18:12.972 --> 00:18:14.963
I am sorry, I have to go.

00:18:16.809 --> 00:18:18.140
Eliza!

00:18:18.944 --> 00:18:22.573
You finally noticed me.
I am so happy to see you again!

00:18:22.982 --> 00:18:24.847
Why is Eliza here?

00:18:25.851 --> 00:18:28.443
Excuse me. Please step aside.

00:18:28.693 --> 00:18:31.412
Eliza, you and Terry know each other?

00:18:31.662 --> 00:18:35.382
Yeah, we were good friends back in London.

00:18:35.532 --> 00:18:36.849
Right, Terry?

00:18:37.099 --> 00:18:38.718
When did you come back?

00:18:38.868 --> 00:18:40.264
Is it only you?

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.963
Answer me, Eliza!

00:18:43.569 --> 00:18:46.663
Terry, don't do this!

00:18:47.339 --> 00:18:50.365
Answer me, Eliza!
Only you came back?

00:18:50.615 --> 00:18:54.107
No. Neal, Stear and Archie,
they are all back.

00:18:54.313 --> 00:18:55.642
Stear and Archie?

00:18:56.582 --> 00:18:58.106
Did you find her, brother?

00:18:59.084 --> 00:19:02.715
No. There is no one here.

00:19:03.155 --> 00:19:05.280
Where could she be? Candy...

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:07.446
She might have gone to the banquet?

00:19:07.596 --> 00:19:09.987
Did Candy come back with you?

00:19:10.137 --> 00:19:12.584
I have no idea what you are talking about!

00:19:12.734 --> 00:19:15.092
Liar! Tell me!

00:19:15.242 --> 00:19:16.526
I really don't know!

00:19:16.676 --> 00:19:18.626
Terrius, stop it!

00:19:21.607 --> 00:19:23.234
It's none of your business!

00:19:23.442 --> 00:19:25.372
Terry, this handkerchief...

00:19:28.713 --> 00:19:32.404
The crew found it

00:19:32.554 --> 00:19:34.573
in the audience stands on the third floor.

00:19:34.723 --> 00:19:35.888
Third floor?

00:19:36.198 --> 00:19:39.020
Only you and Mr. Robert have been there.

00:19:40.192 --> 00:19:42.524
This was mine when I was in London.

00:19:42.761 --> 00:19:44.695
I remember...

00:19:53.158 --> 00:19:54.963
I used this handkerchief
to dress Candy's wound.

00:19:55.113 --> 00:19:57.371
Candy was here!

00:19:58.043 --> 00:20:01.468
She was watching me from third floor!

00:20:01.618 --> 00:20:05.209
It was Candy, it was her yelling!

00:20:06.151 --> 00:20:07.140
Eliza!

00:20:09.888 --> 00:20:11.719
Candy is in town!

00:20:13.825 --> 00:20:16.291
Terry! Where are you going?

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:20.787
He's not over her yet.

00:20:20.937 --> 00:20:23.094
What's so special about her?

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.538
Eliza, Neil, where are you?

00:20:30.175 --> 00:20:31.933
Where are they?

00:20:32.083 --> 00:20:34.671
I am leaving tomorrow morning!

00:20:35.113 --> 00:20:36.580
Anxious and desperate,

00:20:36.915 --> 00:20:40.976
Terry is willing to do anything
to find Candy.

00:20:43.788 --> 00:20:45.813
No, I won't give up!

00:20:46.191 --> 00:20:47.891
I must see him!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.452
It is either tonight or never.

00:20:52.097 --> 00:20:56.090
Candy made a push to carry on!

00:20:58.370 --> 00:20:59.667
Candy!

00:21:00.105 --> 00:21:02.094
Candy and Terry...

00:21:02.244 --> 00:21:07.668
The two of them are looking for each other,
yet they are only a small distance apart.
